# Virtualenvs. Both of these are checked in at df97ab3d and are 99% of the
# repo: 22631 of 22833 tracked files, and most of the 274 MB .git.
.venv/
.venv38/

# Byte-compiled
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Runtime logs. logs/detect.log alone is 33 MB and grows forever.
logs/

# Build products of the Makefile. rx_uhd_ext_gps in particular must be built
# on the station -- see patches/0006 in ionograms-handler: a `make` without it
# produces an -O0 binary. A checked-in copy invites someone to trust the wrong
# one, and `ls -l` on it is how you tell whether a source edit was rebuilt.
rx_uhd
rx_uhd_ext_gps
*.so
*.o

# **The live config is agent-managed state, not source.**
# services/agent/control.py in ionograms-handler rewrites this exact path in
# place -- atomic write plus a timestamped .bak -- every time a setting is
# changed from the console, and BACKLOG sec. 30 plans to make that the normal
# way to move the band. Tracking it would leave the station's working tree
# permanently dirty and stand a merge conflict in front of every pull, on the
# one file whose contents must match what the recorder was built for.
#
# Nothing is lost: docs/chirpsounder2-config.md in ionograms-handler records
# what this station sets, key by key, beside what each key actually does.
my_station.ini
my_station.ini.*.bak
my_station.ini.bak-*
my_station.ini.*T*.bak

# Local scratch
kill.txt
*.swp
.DS_Store
